[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17100.788, "timestamp": "04:45:00", "text": "这是它以这种形式存在的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17105.11, "timestamp": "04:45:05", "text": "在我的……中，呈金色，就像……在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17107.91, "timestamp": "04:45:07", "text": "我的穿搭。这种事确实存在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17111.75, "timestamp": "04:45:11", "text": "这种星形线条以及所有这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17115.91, "timestamp": "04:45:15", "text": "呃，圆形之类的设计就在那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17118.55, "timestamp": "04:45:18", "text": "等等，让我看看手机。我觉得是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17120.948, "timestamp": "04:45:20", "text": "是这样吗？是的。是的。那里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17123.67, "timestamp": "04:45:23", "text": "就是它，它像四角形一样在那里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17125.83, "timestamp": "04:45:25", "text": "星星就在那里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17129.35, "timestamp": "04:45:29", "text": "更像一个长方形。呃，不像不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17132.31, "timestamp": "04:45:32", "text": "长方形。嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17136.628, "timestamp": "04:45:36", "text": "对，矩形，你把它旋转成一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17140.39, "timestamp": "04:45:40", "text": "东西。不像，呃，像四个角"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17143.43, "timestamp": "04:45:43", "text": "就像一颗孤零零的星星。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17147.43, "timestamp": "04:45:47", "text": "它在光芒中。这就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17150.15, "timestamp": "04:45:50", "text": "像日本的那种东西。不是你做什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17154.15, "timestamp": "04:45:54", "text": "叫它什么？那个呃呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17156.788, "timestamp": "04:45:56", "text": "尤卡塔。是的，它有点像尤卡塔（Yucata）那种。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17159.027, "timestamp": "04:45:59", "author": "@aniketwande4403", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m_Z2M4vVHkWPdw0fzo-i-Dy4Pm4-b-bs22Utnn5zkWBHY=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "kimono"}]